      "Developed core workflows using Java Spring, ReactJS, and Sybase ASE.",
      "Recovered ~1 hour of productivity per user per day by independently identifying a review workflow bottleneck and designing a targeted UI fix.",
      "Resolved a critical API bottleneck in the GP Valuations analytics pipeline, cutting QlikView report load time from ~60 min → 10–15 min (~85% reduction).",
